<!-- Real-World Examples -->
<section>
    <h2>Real-World Examples</h2>

    <h3>Button Spacing</h3>

    <p>A typical button with consistent spacing:</p>

    <div class="code-block">
        <pre><code>.button {
  padding: q(8) q(16); // 4px 8px padding
  border-radius: q(4); // 1mm rounded corners
  font-size: q(14); // Text sizing
  gap: q(8); // Space between icon and text
}</code></pre>
    </div>

    <h3>Card Component</h3>

    <p>A card with proper spacing hierarchy:</p>

    <div class="code-block">
        <pre><code>.card {
  padding: q(24); // 1.5rem inner padding
  border-radius: q(8); // 2mm rounded corners
  box-shadow: 0 q(1) q(3) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  margin-bottom: q(16); // Space between cards
}

.card__title {
  margin-bottom: q(8); // Title spacing
}

.card__description {
  margin-bottom: q(12); // Description spacing
}</code></pre>
    </div>

    <h3>Grid Layout</h3>

    <p>Consistent grid gaps using Q units:</p>

    <div class="code-block">
        <pre><code>.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
  gap: q(16); // 8px gaps between items
  padding: q(24); // Container padding
}</code></pre>
    </div>
</section>
